<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox Deepwoken AUTO BHOP</Major>
    <Description>Easy b-hop for roblox deepwoken (Mainly for running away from rights or auto run maybe)

Put on a keybind close to your run button, activate it (maybe loop), then just hold the Forward key (W or Z)

just stop if you wanna redirect yourself!

(Macro's are not bannable on deepwoken, if so, it's still very hard to notice, as it looks like a normal player is doing it)

Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
